	text: [
		"In the world there are certain types of blocks that are needed later on in progression in large quantities, these \"resource\" blocks which are: Hematite, Malachite, Limestone, Bauxite, Chrysotile, and Sulfurous Stone. The latter I recommend avoiding. These resource blocks are spread around the world like patches and are extremely important for progression.",
		"",
		"To mark these resource patches you can make waypoints by pressing V, setting a name for the waypoint, and clicking \"Confirm\"."
